---
// ---- ESTE ES EL NUEVO CÓDIGO PARA: src/pages/normas.astro ----

// 1. Importamos la plantilla, igual que en index.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Normas del Sendero - Escuela Pública Ruca Raqui">

  <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 via-green-50 to-amber-50 py-20 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-72 h-72 bg-green-200 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-xl opacity-30 animate-blob"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-72 h-72 bg-amber-200 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-xl opacity-30 animate-blob animation-delay-2000"></div>
    <div class="absolute -bottom-8 left-20 w-72 h-72 bg-emerald-200 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-xl opacity-30 animate-blob animation-delay-4000"></div>
    
    <div class="relative container mx-auto px-4 text-center">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-6 font-playfair">
          Normas del Sendero
        </h1>
        <div class="w-32 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-green-400 to-amber-400 mx-auto mb-8 rounded-full"></div>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          "Wiño kimtuayin tañi rüpü, küll küll rüpül, mawizantu-menoko"
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 italic">
          Volvamos a conocer nuestro sendero-camino, bosque-humedal
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12 bg-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            El Sendero Pedagógico es un <span class="text-green-600 font-medium">espacio sagrado y educativo</span>. 
            Su preservación depende del respeto mutuo entre visitantes, comunidad y naturaleza.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <main class="container mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      
      <div class="group bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-8 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:border-green-200">
        <div class="flex items-start mb-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-green-500 to-emerald-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mr-4 shadow-lg">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M12 11c0 3.517-1.009 6.799-2.753 9.571m-3.44-2.04l.054-.09A13.916 13.916 0 008 11a4 4 0 118 0c0 1.017-.07 2.019-.203 3m-2.118 6.844A21.88 21.88 0 0015.171 17m3.839 1.132c.645-2.266.99-4.659.99-7.132A8 8 0 008 4.07M3 15.364c.64-1.319 1-2.8 1-4.364 0-1.457.39-2.823 1.07-4"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 font-playfair">Respeto Espiritual</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-1">Honrando la cultura Mapuche Lafkenche</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start group/item p-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-green-50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-green-500 mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0">●</span>
            <span class="text-gray-700">Territorio mapuche lafkenche - camine con respeto</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start group/item p-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-green-50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-green-500 mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0">●</span>
            <span class="text-gray-700">No alterar espacios ceremoniales (menoko, rewe)</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start group/item p-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-green-50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-green-500 mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0">●</span>
            <span class="text-gray-700">Silencio en áreas de reflexión espiritual</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start group/item p-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-green-50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-green-500 mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0">●</span>
            <span class="text-gray-700">Respetar ceremonias y actividades culturales</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start group/item p-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-green-50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-green-500 mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0">●</span>
            <span class="text-gray-700">Pedir permiso antes de fotografiar</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="group bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-8 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:border-blue-200">
        <div class="flex items-start mb-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-cyan-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mr-4 shadow-lg">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M3.055 11H5a2 2 0 012 2v1a2 2 0 002 2 2 2 0 012 2v2.945M8 3.935V5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0010.5 8h.5a2 2 0 012 2 2 2 0 104 0 2 2 0 012-2h1.064M15 20.488V18a2 2 0 012-2h3.064M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 font-playfair">Cuidado Ambiental</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-1">Protegiendo el bosque-humedal</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start group/item p-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-blue-50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-blue-500 mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0">●</span>
            <span class="text-gray-700">No dejar basura - llevar todo lo traído</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start group/item p-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-blue-50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-blue-500 mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0">●</span>
            <span class="text-gray-700">No extraer plantas, piedras o elementos naturales</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start group/item p-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-blue-50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-blue-500 mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0">●</span>
            <span class="text-gray-700">Caminar solo por senderos demarcados</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start group/item p-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-blue-50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-blue-500 mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0">●</span>
            <span class="text-gray-700">No alimentar a la fauna silvestre</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start group/item p-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-blue-50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-blue-500 mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0">●</span>
            <span class="text-gray-700">Respetar la biodiversidad del humedal y bosque</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="group bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-8 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:border-red-200">
        <div class="flex items-start mb-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500 to-orange-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mr-4 shadow-lg">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 font-playfair">Prohibiciones</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-1">Para la seguridad de todos</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start group/item p-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-red-50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-red-500 mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0">✗</span>
            <span class="text-gray-700">Prohibido fumar o consumir alcohol</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start group/item p-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-red-50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-red-500 mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0">✗</span>
            <span class="text-gray-700">No ingresar con mascotas</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start group/item p-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-red-50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-red-500 mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0">✗</span>
            <span class="text-gray-700">Prohibido hacer fogatas o usar fuentes de calor</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start group/item p-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-red-50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-red-500 mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0">✗</span>
            <span class="text-gray-700">No usar drones sin autorización</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start group/item p-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-red-50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-red-500 mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0">✗</span>
            <span class="text-gray-700">Prohibido el ingreso con equipos de sonido</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="group bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-8 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:border-amber-200">
        <div class="flex items-start mb-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500 to-yellow-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mr-4 shadow-lg">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 font-playfair">Recomendaciones</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-1">Para una mejor experiencia</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start group/item p-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-amber-500 mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0">✓</span>
            <span class="text-gray-700">Calzado cómodo y ropa adecuada para caminata</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start group/item p-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-amber-500 mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0">✓</span>
            <span class="text-gray-700">Hidratarse adecuadamente during el recorrido</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start group/item p-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-amber-500 mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0">✓</span>
            <span class="text-gray-700">Seguir las indicaciones de los guías estudiantiles</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start group/item p-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-amber-500 mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0">✓</span>
            <span class="text-gray-700">Preguntar ante cualquier duda sobre el territorio</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start group/item p-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-amber-500 mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0">✓</span>
            <span class="text-gray-700">Disfrutar el aprendizaje y conexión con naturaleza</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <section class="py-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-green-50">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-green-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-green-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M14 10h4.764a2 2 0 011.789 2.894l-3.5 7A2 2 0 0115.263 21h-4.017c-.163 0-.326-.02-.485-.06L7 20m7-10V5a2 2 0 00-2-2h-.095c-.5 0-.905.405-.905.905 0 .714-.211 1.412-.608 2.006L7 11v9m7-10h-2M7 20H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2h2.5"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4 font-playfair">Honrando el Küme Mogen</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            "Este sendero es más que un camino: es un espacio de aprendizaje vivo que conecta 
            saberes ancestrales mapuche con conocimiento científico. Tu respeto contribuye a 
            mantener el <span class="text-green-600 font-medium">Küme Mogen</span> (buen vivir) y el 
            <span class="text-green-600 font-medium">Fillke Mogen</span> (convivencia armónica)."
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-500 mt-6 font-medium">
            - Equipo Escuela Pública Ruca Raqui
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>